<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer-Standard buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer-Standard buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres &amp; Co analyst Mandana Hormozi said Friday he began coverage of Pioneer-Standard Electronics Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect the company's growth to continue to outpace industry growth as Pioneer-Standard expands its market share,&quot; the analyst said in a report.</p>
<p>-- He added that earnings per share growth likely will continue to outpace revenue growth.</p>
<p>-- He estimates fiscal 1998 earnings at $1.25 a share and fiscal 1999 at $1.50 a share.  </p>
<p>-- A 12-month price target of $19 a share was established.</p>
<p>-- Pioneer-Standard shares were unchanged at 13-9/16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
